# Local-only secrets for `npm run dev` (wrangler/miniflare reads `web/.dev.vars`).
#
#   1. cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#   2. paste your real key below
#   3. npm run dev
#
# `.dev.vars` is git-ignored — never commit a real key.

# --- AI Gateway key (required for /chat) ---------------------------------
# The chat runs through the Vercel AI Gateway, not a provider API directly.
# Create a key at:  vercel.com  ->  AI Gateway  ->  API Keys
# Every account includes $5 of free credit per month.
#
# For the deployed Worker, use a secret instead of this file:
#
#   npx wrangler secret put AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY
#
# Without this key, POST /api/chat answers 503 and /chat shows a setup notice.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=vck_...

# --- Optional ------------------------------------------------------------
# Override the model the concierge agent uses. Any slug from the gateway's
# model list works:  curl https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models
# Defaults to anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.
# CHAT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5
